---
// Figure 02 — cost vs. correctness scatter.
//
// Plot box x 56→288, y 40→172. Y axis 0→.50 (.00 at y=172, .25 at 108.5, .50
// at 45); X axis 0→5000 tokens (0 at x=56, 2.5K at 169, 5K at 282).
//
// The trajectory path connects A→B→C so the rise-then-fall is visible: the
// autonomous agent costs 3.8× the tokens of the fixed workflow and produces
// FEWER correct conclusions (.41 → .36). That shape is the whole point of the
// figure — do not smooth or reorder it.
//
// C's label is right-anchored at x=288 and sits below the point so the
// trajectory path does not strike through it.
//
// Values come from ecommerce-analytics-agent results/comparison.csv, 38 graded
// tasks. Do not round or adjust them.
---

<figure class="fig">
	<div class="frame">
		<svg
			viewBox="0 0 300 225"
			preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet"
			role="img"
			aria-label="Correct conclusions against tokens per task: single LLM call 0.24 at 784 tokens, fixed workflow 0.41 at 1285 tokens, autonomous agent 0.36 at 4892 tokens."
		>
			<text x="12" y="19" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="0.9" fill="var(--muted)">CORRECT CONCLUSIONS (SHARE)</text>

			<g stroke="var(--gridline)" stroke-width="1">
				<line x1="56" y1="45" x2="288" y2="45"></line>
				<line x1="56" y1="108.5" x2="288" y2="108.5"></line>
			</g>

			<g font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--faint)" text-anchor="end">
				<text x="50" y="48">.50</text>
				<text x="50" y="111.5">.25</text>
				<text x="50" y="175">.00</text>
			</g>

			<line x1="56" y1="172" x2="288" y2="172" stroke="var(--rule)" stroke-width="1"></line>

			<path d="M 91.4,111.8 L 114.1,68.4 L 277.1,81.8" fill="none" stroke="var(--trajectory)" stroke-width="1.2"></path>

			<circle cx="91.4" cy="111.8" r="3.4" fill="var(--faint)"></circle>
			<text x="97" y="124" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="0.4" fill="var(--muted)">A SINGLE CALL · .24</text>

			<circle cx="114.1" cy="68.4" r="3.8" fill="var(--muted)"></circle>
			<text x="120" y="64" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="0.4" fill="var(--ink)">B FIXED WORKFLOW · .41</text>

			<circle cx="277.1" cy="81.8" r="4.4" fill="var(--accent)"></circle>
			<text x="288" y="97" text-anchor="end" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="0.4" fill="var(--accent)">C AGENT · .36</text>

			<g font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" fill="var(--faint)" text-anchor="middle">
				<text x="56" y="185">0</text>
				<text x="169" y="185">2.5K</text>
				<text x="282" y="185">5K</text>
			</g>

			<text x="12" y="200" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="0.4" fill="var(--faint)">TOKENS PER TASK →</text>
			<text x="12" y="214" font-family="var(--mono)" font-size="9.5" letter-spacing="0.4" fill="var(--faint)">38 GRADED TASKS · 3.8× COST, NO GAIN</text>
		</svg>
	</div>

	<figcaption>Source · ecommerce-analytics-agent / results/comparison.csv</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
	.fig {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.frame {
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
		border: 1px solid var(--rule);
		background: var(--panel);
	}

	svg {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
	}

	figcaption {
		margin: 8px 0 0;
		font-family: var(--mono);
		font-size: var(--fs-figcaption);
		line-height: 1.45;
		letter-spacing: var(--track-figcaption);
		text-transform: uppercase;
		color: var(--faint);
	}
</style>
